[OC]|cffffffffLevel 30|r  -  you step off the Menethil boat at Southshore with the Excavation Site behind you; hearth = Sentinel Hill and it stays there (nothing here needs it). Southshore is the best quest hub of the 30s and every core mob is a plain non-elite: ~14,000 quest XP on the core loops and up to ~23,000 with the optional extras. The Murloc Heads and the Turtle Meat have no drop rate in the DB, so each carries a budget below. You ding 31 around Gnomeregan (chapter 24).
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried on:|r the three City of Dalaran lead-ins (92456 and 92489 from chapter 15, 92432 here) ride on to the 30-40 guide. Reassignment (563) and, if you take it, Return to Milton (542) are handed in at Stormwind in chapter 25.
[OC]|cffffcc00Skipped on purpose:|r Talk of the Town (98463, Barkeep Kelly: 265 XP, an errand to Booty Bay), A Lack of Virtue (98459, Tom Half-fish: 165 XP, to Menethil, which the route does not revisit) and Foreboding Plans / Noble Deaths (510, 512: the Syndicate mobs for the rings are level 35-39).
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r nothing in Southshore trains you; if you did not train level 30 in Darnassus, it waits for the Ironforge warrior trainer (chapter 24).

[OC]|cffffffffSouthshore|r  -  the flight path is already known (chapter 08), so there is nothing to do on the dock. Every giver stands within 8 units of the flight master (49.3,52.3); Captain McManus is 4 units north-west of it
